abstract: "AsiBackbone is a .NET package-family project providing framework-neutral governance primitives for consequential software decision flow. Version 3.2.0 is a backward-compatible minor release for the stable 3.x line that adds explicit capability-grant validation profiles for consequential execution boundaries and intentional metadata-only inspection, while preserving the existing configurable validation path for 3.x compatibility. Package IDs, public namespaces, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 3.0.0.0 remain unchanged; authentication, authorization, durable replay protection, signing-key custody, and external execution remain host-owned responsibilities."
